WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:01.815
Module 8.

00:00:01.815 --> 00:00:03.890
The DeFi Operating System.

00:00:03.890 --> 00:00:05.925
Part of Stage 4, Strategist.

00:00:07.225 --> 00:00:09.525
By the end of this module, you'll be

00:00:09.525 --> 00:00:12.198
able to a written portfolio plan with risk

00:00:12.198 --> 00:00:14.860
buckets, limits and an emergency plan.

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:16.215
That's the standard.

00:00:16.215 --> 00:00:18.185
Every lesson moves you toward it.

00:00:19.485 --> 00:00:23.610
There are 7 lessons, starting with DeFi portfolio construction.

00:00:23.610 --> 00:00:25.589
Each one ends with a checklist to

00:00:25.589 --> 00:00:27.860
do for real, and a three-question quiz.

00:00:29.160 --> 00:00:30.762
If the topic is new to

00:00:30.762 --> 00:00:33.570
you, start with Mastery Starter 8.0.

00:00:33.570 --> 00:00:35.465
It takes about ten minutes.

00:00:35.465 --> 00:00:37.619
Then take the lessons in order, because

00:00:37.619 --> 00:00:39.750
each one builds on the one before.

00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:41.557
And do the checklists for real,

00:00:41.557 --> 00:00:43.590
with small test amounts, every time.

00:00:44.890 --> 00:00:47.305
Let's begin, with lesson 8.0.
